optimization algorithm. It abstracts the possible solution to a chromo­
some, and uses a gene to represent a dimension of the solution. The 
evolutionary algorithm adopts heuristic methods to select high-quality 
chromosomes through natural conditions (fitness function) generation 
by generation, and chromosome recombination, mutation and other 
operations to generate new and better chromosomes. The workflow of 
